        "result": "Uniform direct-decomposition decision and factor construction for finite presentations promised to define finitely generated nilpotent groups, including torsion.",
        "prior_scope": "Torsion-free decision and rational decomposition machinery are prior. Potentially new scope is the general torsion case.",
